#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/configuration/generated-output.md:11
msgid ""
"同一不可变 IR 原子产生静态连接和审查数据。应用只修改作者 TOML、Board/SoC事实或实现源码，不手工修补 generated 目录。"
msgstr ""
"The same immutable IR atomically produces static connections and review "
"data. Applications change authored TOML, Board/SoC facts or implementation "
"sources, never patch the generated directory by hand."

