#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/configuration/generated-output.md:25
msgid ""
"未选类别不生成相应 getter/ID。factory 不分配、不启动设备；先检查 getter "
"返回，再按平台生命周期使用接口。CMake自动传递已选公共生成头的需要，组件实现私有要求不进入应用头闭包。"
msgstr ""
"Unselected classes emit no corresponding getters or IDs. The factory neither"
" allocates nor starts devices; check getter results before using interfaces "
"according to the platform lifecycle. CMake automatically propagates selected"
" public generated-header requirements; private implementation requirements "
"of components do not enter the application's header closure."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/configuration/generated-output.md:27
msgid "输出身份"
msgstr "Output identity"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/configuration/generated-output.md:29
msgid ""
"`resolved.json` "
"是当前格式的单向输出，省略未选候选路线。`fact_references`用路径和SHA-256引用原始事实，完整IR仍用于校验与候选查询。配置摘要基于完整有效决策；JSON不是可信输入，原始事实摘要不能替代编译器或代码身份。"
msgstr ""
"`resolved.json` is a one-way output in the current format and omits "
"unselected candidate routes. `fact_references` identifies original facts by "
"path and SHA-256; complete IR still serves validation and candidate queries."
" The configuration digest covers all effective decisions. JSON is not "
"trusted input, and original fact digests do not replace compiler or code "
"identities."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/configuration/generated-output.md:31
msgid ""
"SDK解析与checkout可能有不同输入来源和配置摘要。审查真实输入，不删除身份字段来强行匹配。当前格式值见[SDK与格式合同](../contracts/sdk-"
"format.md)。"
msgstr ""
"SDK resolution and checkouts may have different input sources and "
"configuration digests. Review actual inputs; do not delete identity fields "
"to force a match. See the [SDK and format contract](../contracts/sdk-"
"format.md) for current format values."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/configuration/generated-output.md:33
msgid "生成、失败与增量"
msgstr "Generation, failure and incrementality"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/configuration/generated-output.md:35
msgid ""
"从所选源码根使用配置CLI的 `check`、`explain` 和 "
"`generate`，传入自己的完整assembly与拥有的输出目录；命令参数见[工具参考](tools.md)。生成成功不等于编译或硬件执行成功。"
msgstr ""
"Run the configuration CLI's `check`, `explain` and `generate` from the "
"selected source root with your complete assembly and an output directory you"
" own. See [tool reference](tools.md) for arguments. Successful generation "
"does not imply successful compilation or hardware execution."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/configuration/generated-output.md:37
msgid ""
"拒绝或中断使该次输出失效，不能继续消费旧头或bindings。相同生成内容保留时间戳；TOML、所选事实或生成器改变由构建图重新配置。ELF、BIN、map和资源报告分别由固件target维护，见[构建合同](../contracts/build-"
"system.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Rejection or interruption invalidates that execution's output; old headers "
"or bindings must not be consumed. Identical generated content retains "
"timestamps. TOML, selected fact or generator changes trigger reconfiguration"
" through the build graph. The firmware target separately maintains ELF, BIN,"
" map and resource reports; see the [build contract](../contracts/build-"
"system.md)."
